# Static-asset response headers (Workers static assets).
# Pages are never framed: the agent pages ask for consent (approve an agent,
# authorize an MCP client), so another site must not overlay them and trick a
# click (clickjacking). Applied to every asset so that the service worker's
# precached index.html carries the same headers.
/*
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'none'
